    "text": "Visual_System manages the visual rendering channel. It does not render itself — it delegates to a swappable renderer (Orbital_System, Graph_System, Particle_System, Grid_System, or Waveform_System). This is Alchem module autonomy applied to rendering: you can replace Orbital_System with any other renderer without touching Visual_System or Interface_System. The visual channel expresses Luna's state as position, movement, color, and form. It listens to LUNA_STATE_CHANGE on the bus and passes the state to the active renderer."
